  "notes": "Hand-finished from providers/cockroachdb/tables.py. Constraint grids send their own lists (primary_key, unique_constraints, foreign_keys, check_constraints); in alter mode only a changed grid is sent and the provider diffs it against the constraints in the table record. Changed cells on existing columns arrive as alter_columns. Key membership and family are fixed per existing column (editable_after_create). Round trip verified live on CockroachDB 26.1.3 by tools/tests/test_ui_descriptor_roundtrip_cockroachdb.py (2026-10-30).",
